# Per-tool python venvs (one per directory keeps deps isolated)
**/.venv/

# Python build artefacts
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/

# Test / smoke outputs
**/_test_out/
**/_smoke_out/
**/_local_test_out/

# Mock-mode placeholders written by `--mock` runs (cg-render writes here
# when assets_root falls back to CWD/_assets — the fixture sets a /tmp
# path but defensive ignore catches accidental runs from this dir).
**/_assets/
